            <span>&bull;</span>
            <span>Phone Lock Screen Alerts</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
            ⚡ Live Mobile Push Notifications & Real-Time Alerts
          </h2>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Get pinged on your phone lock screen or browser the second a lead replies, requests a meeting, or reports an auto-reply. Works in the background even if this tab is closed.
          </p>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-xs">
            <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Device Status:</span>
            <span id="push-status-badge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">
              Checking notification capability...
