            <input
              type="text"
              id="field-niches"
              required
              value="Videographer, Dentist, Gym Coach"
              placeholder="e.g. Videographer, Dentist, Gym Coach"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500 neon-border-glow transition"
            >
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Comma-separated industries. The engine automatically segments and balances outreach.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Target Cities -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
              Target Cities & Territories *
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="field-cities"
              required
              value="London, Manchester, New York"
              placeholder="e.g. London, Manchester, New York"
              class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500 neon-border-glow transition"
            >
          </div>

          <!-- Two Column Row: Daily Limit + Portfolio URL -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            
            <!-- Daily Limit per Sender -->
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
                Daily Limit per Sender *
              </label>
              <div class="relative">
                <input
                  type="number"
                  id="field-daily-limit"
                  required
                  min="5"
                  max="200"
                  value="30"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 text-sm text-cyan-300 font-bold focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500 neon-border-glow transition"
                >
                <span class="absolute right-3.5 top-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400 pointer-events-none">emails/day</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Default 30 protects your domain warmup score.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Portfolio / Reel URL -->
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
                Portfolio / Showreel URL
              </label>
              <input
                type="url"
                id="field-portfolio-url"
                value="https://visualsky.pro/reel"
                placeholder="https://visualsky.pro/reel or Drive folder link"
                class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 text-sm text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500 neon-border-glow transition"
              >
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Auto-injected into token: <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">{{portfolioUrl}}</code></p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Service Pitch / Offer Textarea -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
                Service Pitch / Offer *
              </label>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Tokens: <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">{{firstName}}</code>, <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">{{businessName}}</code>, <code class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">{{city}}</code></span>
            </div>
            <textarea
              id="field-service-pitch"
              rows="6"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500 neon-border-glow transition font-mono leading-relaxed"
            >Hi {{firstName}},

I came across {{businessName}} in {{city}} and was really impressed with your brand.

We specialize in scaling client acquisition and video post-production for high-growth businesses. We recently helped a similar team double their inbound booking rate within 30 days.

You can check out our recent project showreel here:
{{portfolioUrl}}

Would you be open to a quick 5-minute review call this Thursday at 2 PM to see if this makes sense for {{businessName}}?

Best regards,
VisualSky Production Team</textarea>
          </div>

          <!-- Submit Button -->
